{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 9, :comments ["<b>On that day.</b> His fortified cities — those of Israel." "<b>The forest.</b> The tree, like חורש מצל (Ezekiel 31:3)." "<b>And the branches.</b> That which is above, and behold it is the root and the branch." "<b>Which they abandoned.</b> The Canaanites, when they fled before Israel upon their coming into the land of Canaan." "<b>And it shall be.</b> Samaria <b>a desolation</b>, for it is the royal city."], :book :isaiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 17, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Isaiah, by M. Friedlander; Society of Hebrew Literature, London 1877" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001338443"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:54:07.619339775Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}